{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"a100000000000001","type":"text","x":-3400,"y":-500,"width":8300,"height":180,"color":"6","text":"# 多元优化 · 从最优候选到价值变化\n\n统一约定：最大化问题的不等式写成 $g(x)\\le 0$，Lagrangian 取 $\\mathcal L=f-\\lambda^Tg-\\nu^Th$。读图时始终分开三件事：最优值是否取得、候选点从哪来、候选点何时真的最优。"},
		{"id":"a100000000000002","type":"text","x":-3400,"y":-220,"width":8300,"height":140,"color":"3","text":"## 1 · 无约束：存在、候选与局部/全局验证\n\n连续 + 紧致负责取得性；零梯度只生成开域内点候选；点上的 Hessian 负责局部分类；在整个凸域上的凹性才把局部最大升级为全局最大。"},
		{"id":"a100000000000003","type":"text","x":-2800,"y":20,"width":520,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n### [[极值定理|Extreme value theorem]]\n\nA continuous real-valued function on a nonempty compact domain attains a maximum and a minimum. This guarantees existence, not their locations.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n非空紧集上的连续实值函数取得最大值与最小值；定理保证存在，不负责定位。"},
		{"id":"a100000000000004","type":"text","x":-1700,"y":20,"width":520,"height":340,"color":"5","text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[无约束一阶条件|Interior first-order condition]]\nAt a local extremum in the ambient interior, differentiability at that point forces $Df=0$. This necessary condition identifies candidates; it does not establish an extremum.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**无约束一阶条件**：环境空间内点的局部极值，若在该点可微，必有 $Df=0$。这是必要的候选条件，不保证极值。"},
		{"id":"a100000000000005","type":"text","x":-600,"y":20,"width":520,"height":340,"color":"4","text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Hessian 局部极大判据|Hessian maximum test]]\nFor real scalar $f\\in C^2$ near an interior stationary point $a$, negative-definite $H_f(a)$ guarantees a strict local maximum; global maximality needs a separate argument.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**Hessian 局部极大判据**：实值函数在内点驻点附近为 $C^2$，且 Hessian 负定，便有严格局部极大；并不自动成为全局最大。"},
		{"id":"a100000000000006","type":"text","x":500,"y":20,"width":520,"height":340,"color":"1","text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[半定Hessian无结论|Singular semidefinite Hessians]]\nAt an interior stationary point of a real $C^2$ function, singular semidefiniteness leaves classification incomplete. A nonzero positive-semidefinite Hessian still rules out a local maximum.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**半定Hessian无结论**：实值 $C^2$ 函数在内点驻点的奇异半定 Hessian 不能完成分类；但非零半正定仍排除局部极大。"},
		{"id":"a100000000000007","type":"text","x":1800,"y":20,"width":600,"height":280,"color":"4","text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[凸优化全局性|Local and global optima]]\n\nOn a convex feasible set, a local maximum of a concave objective is global.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n在凸可行集上，凹目标的每个局部最大点都是全局最大点。"},
		{"id":"c100000000000001","type":"text","x":1800,"y":450,"width":600,"height":280,"color":"1","text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[严格凹不保证解存在|Uniqueness and attainment]]\n\nOn a convex feasible set, strict concavity gives at most one maximizer; nonemptiness and attainment remain separate.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n凸可行集上，严格凹只给“若取得，则至多一个”；非空与取得性必须另证。"},
		{"id":"a100000000000008","type":"text","x":-3400,"y":1100,"width":8300,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"## 2 · 加入约束：可行方向、约束资格与 KKT 证书\n\n等式约束把移动限制在切空间；不等式还要分活动与松弛。LICQ 在候选点检查活动法向量，Slater 在凸问题中寻找严格可行点；两条路线不是同一个条件。"},
		{"id":"a100000000000009","type":"text","x":-2500,"y":1400,"width":520,"height":340,"color":"5","text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Lagrange必要条件|Lagrange necessity]]\n\nAt a feasible local optimum with C¹ data nearby and full-row-rank equality Jacobian, the objective gradient lies in the span of equality gradients.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n可行局部最优点附近，目标与等式约束为 C¹；等式 Jacobian 满行秩时，目标梯度必落在等式约束梯度张成的空间。"},
		{"id":"a10000000000000a","type":"text","x":-2500,"y":1950,"width":520,"height":200,"color":"6","text":"### [[等边际原则|等边际原则]]\n\n预算等式下的经济学应用：内部最优使每元边际效用相等。"},
		{"id":"a10000000000000b","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":1950,"width":550,"height":220,"color":"4","text":"### [[等式约束二阶条件|等式约束二阶条件]]\n\n只在可行切空间检查 Lagrangian Hessian；严格定号是充分而非必要。"},
		{"id":"c100000000000002","type":"text","x":-3400,"y":1950,"width":520,"height":220,"color":"1","text":"### [[乘子不是精确罚金|乘子不是精确罚金]]\n\nLagrange 乘子是法向量系数；精确罚函数是需要另行证明阈值性质的新目标。"},
		{"id":"c100000000000003","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":2450,"width":550,"height":220,"color":"1","text":"### [[严格最优不推系统非奇异|严格最优不推非奇异]]\n\n高阶项也能形成严格最优；比较静态所需 Jacobian 可逆性必须独立检查。"},
		{"id":"a10000000000000f","type":"text","x":-600,"y":1400,"width":520,"height":340,"color":"5","text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[KKT条件|KKT conditions]]\n\nA candidate and its multipliers must jointly satisfy primal feasibility, multiplier signs, stationarity and complementary slackness.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n原问题可行、对偶可行、驻点与互补松弛组成一个联立系统。"},
		{"id":"a100000000000010","type":"text","x":-600,"y":1950,"width":520,"height":340,"color":"5","text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[互补松弛|Complementary slackness]]\n\nFor each inequality, the nonnegative multiplier times the nonnegative slack is zero. Both may be zero.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n每条不等式的非负乘子与非负松弛量的乘积为零。两者可以同时为零。"},
		{"id":"c100000000000006","type":"text","x":-600,"y":2500,"width":520,"height":340,"color":"1","text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[绑定不推正乘子|Binding with a zero multiplier]]\n\nAn active constraint can have a zero multiplier, even under LICQ. Activity is determined by the constraint value.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n约束取等号时乘子仍可为零；活动集不能按正乘子定义。即使满足 LICQ，也允许这种情况。"},
		{"id":"a10000000000000d","type":"text","x":1400,"y":2450,"width":520,"height":380,"color":"5","text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[LICQ条件|LICQ]]\n\nAt a feasible point, LICQ requires the indexed gradients of all equalities and active inequalities to be linearly independent. Repeated or zero gradients must remain in the test.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n可行点处，全部等式与活动不等式梯度按约束索引检查线性无关；重复或零梯度都保留。"},
		{"id":"c100000000000004","type":"text","x":2400,"y":2450,"width":520,"height":260,"color":"2","text":"### [[Slater不等于LICQ|Slater ≠ LICQ]]\n\n一个查整个凸问题的严格可行点，一个查指定点的活动梯度。"},
		{"id":"a10000000000000e","type":"text","x":3400,"y":2450,"width":520,"height":300,"color":"5","text":"### [[Slater条件|Slater 条件]]\n\n在相对内部寻找严格满足适用凸不等式、精确满足仿射等式的点。它在凸问题中通过强对偶补上“最优 ⇒ KKT”。"},
		{"id":"c100000000000007","type":"text","x":400,"y":3050,"width":520,"height":320,"color":"2","text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[LICQ保证乘子唯一|Multiplier uniqueness]]\n\nAt one fixed KKT point with the same constraint functions, LICQ makes the existing multiplier vector unique.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n同一 KKT 点、同一约束表示下，LICQ 使已有的乘子向量唯一。"},
		{"id":"c100000000000008","type":"text","x":1400,"y":3050,"width":520,"height":320,"color":"1","text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[LICQ不是KKT必要条件|LICQ failure]]\n\nWhen LICQ fails, KKT multipliers may exist or may fail to exist; inspect the equations.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\nLICQ 失败只让一条保证路线失效；具体问题仍可能有 KKT 乘子。"},
		{"id":"c100000000000005","type":"text","x":400,"y":1950,"width":520,"height":340,"color":"5","text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[KKT必要性|KKT necessity]]\n\nA local optimum of a C¹ problem admits KKT multipliers under a suitable constraint qualification. LICQ is one sufficient qualification.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\nC¹ 问题的局部最优，在适当约束资格下存在 KKT 乘子；LICQ 是一种充分资格。"},
		{"id":"c100000000000009","type":"text","x":2900,"y":1950,"width":520,"height":300,"color":"2","text":"### [[Slater强对偶|Slater 强对偶]]\n\n凸问题满足 Slater 且最优值有限时，强对偶成立并可取得最优乘子，从而给出最优 → KKT。"},
		{"id":"a100000000000011","type":"text","x":4200,"y":1950,"width":620,"height":400,"color":"4","text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[KKT充分性|KKT sufficiency]]\n\nFor differentiable data on a common open convex domain: a concave objective, convex inequalities and affine equalities make every KKT candidate globally optimal. This direction needs no Slater condition.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n在共同开凸域及可微前提下：凹目标 + 凸不等式 + 仿射等式使任何 KKT 点成为全局最大；该方向不需 Slater。"},
		{"id":"c10000000000000a","type":"text","x":4200,"y":2850,"width":620,"height":400,"color":"1","text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[严格凹不保证乘子唯一|Primal and multiplier uniqueness]]\n\nStrict concavity on a convex feasible set gives at most one maximizer. Even at a unique optimum, dependent constraint gradients may allow multiple multiplier vectors.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n在凸可行集上且最优点已取得时：严格凹可使最优选择唯一；相关活动法向量仍允许多组乘子。"},
		{"id":"a100000000000013","type":"text","x":-3400,"y":3700,"width":8300,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"## 3 · 参数变化：最优选择怎么变，最优价值怎么变？\n\n值函数 $v(\\theta)$ 记录“最好能有多好”，最优解对应 $S(\\theta)$ 记录“哪些选择做到了”。IFT 追踪一条选择分支；Envelope 与 Danskin 直接追踪价值。"},
		{"id":"a100000000000012","type":"text","x":-2600,"y":4050,"width":520,"height":220,"color":"5","text":"### [[值函数|值函数]]\n\n$v(\\theta)$ 把参数映射为该问题能达到或逼近的最优目标值。"},
		{"id":"e100000000000001","type":"text","x":-1400,"y":4050,"width":520,"height":220,"color":"5","text":"### [[最优解对应|最优解对应]]\n\n$S(\\theta)$ 收集所有达到 $v(\\theta)$ 的可行选择；它可为空、单点或多值。"},
		{"id":"a100000000000015","type":"text","x":-2600,"y":4550,"width":520,"height":220,"color":"4","text":"### [[包络定理|包络定理]]\n\n正则可微最优分支上，Lagrangian 驻点与约束全微分给 $dv/d\\theta=\\mathcal L_\\theta$。"},
		{"id":"a100000000000014","type":"text","x":-1400,"y":4550,"width":520,"height":220,"color":"6","text":"### [[隐函数比较静态|隐函数比较静态]]\n\n活动制度固定且最优性系统 Jacobian 非奇异时，全微分方程以追踪选择分支。"},
		{"id":"e100000000000002","type":"text","x":0,"y":4050,"width":600,"height":270,"color":"4","text":"### [[Danskin定理|Danskin 定理]]\n\n选择集非空紧、目标连续且对参数凸可微、参数梯度联合连续时，价值的方向导数取当前最优解中最大的直接方向效应。"},
		{"id":"a100000000000016","type":"text","x":0,"y":4550,"width":600,"height":240,"color":"1","text":"### [[优化器跳跃不推价值不可微|优化器跳跃 ⇏ 价值不可微]]\n\n选择路径跳跃时，价值可能仍可微，也可能有折点；必须直接检查 $v$。"},
		{"id":"a100000000000017","type":"text","x":-2600,"y":5050,"width":520,"height":220,"color":"6","text":"### [[影子价格|影子价格]]\n\n影子价格是约束右端边际放宽时最优价值的一阶变化率；正则时由对应乘子表示。"},
		{"id":"b100000000000001","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":1400,"width":550,"height":360,"color":"3","text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## From equality to inequality constraints\n\nKKT retains Lagrange stationarity and adds primal feasibility, multiplier signs and complementary slackness.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**从等式约束扩展到不等式约束**\n\nKKT 保留 Lagrange 驻点，并加入原问题可行性、对偶可行性与互补松弛。"},
		{"id":"b100000000000004","type":"text","x":4200,"y":600,"width":620,"height":360,"color":"3","text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[KKT充分性|Sufficient structure for KKT]]\n\nFor differentiable maximization on an open convex domain: a concave objective, convex inequalities $g_i\\le0$ and affine equalities make feasible KKT points globally optimal.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n开凸域上可微的最大化问题：凹目标、凸不等式 $g_i\\le0$ 与仿射等式构成充分结构，使可行 KKT 点全局最优。"},
		{"id":"sofp-stationary","type":"text","x":-1700,"y":550,"width":520,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[驻点|Stationary points]]\nAt a differentiable interior point of a real scalar function, $Df=0$ defines stationarity. It means zero first-order change in every direction, not a zero function value or an optimum.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**驻点**：实值函数在可微内点满足 $Df=0$，就称为驻点：各方向一阶变化为零；并非函数值为零，也不自动是极值。"},
		{"id":"sofp-global","type":"text","x":-600,"y":550,"width":520,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[凹函数驻点全局最优|Stationary points and global maxima]]\n\nFor a differentiable concave function on an open convex domain, zero gradient gives a global maximum.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n开凸域上的可微凹函数：零梯度代入切平面上界，得到全局最大。"},
		{"id":"sofp-quasi","type":"text","x":500,"y":550,"width":520,"height":340,"text":"<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[拟凹驻点不保证最优|Quasiconcavity and stationary points]]\n\nOn the real line, x³ is quasiconcave and stationary at zero, but has no extremum there. Quasiconcavity alone cannot replace concavity in the stationary-point theorem.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\nx³ 拟凹且在零点驻定，却无极值；驻点定理中的凹性不能直接改成拟凹性。"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"f100000000000001","fromNode":"a100000000000004","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a100000000000005","toSide":"left","label":"At an interior stationary point,\nadd C² and a Hessian sign test ·\n在内点驻点再检查 C² 与 Hessian 定号"},
		{"id":"f100000000000002","fromNode":"a100000000000005","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a100000000000006","toSide":"left","label":"Singular semidefinite curvature\nneeds further analysis ·\n奇异半定曲率仍需进一步分析"},
		{"id":"f100000000000003","fromNode":"a100000000000007","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"c100000000000001","toSide":"top","label":"Strictness adds uniqueness /\n严格性增加唯一性"},
		{"id":"f100000000000004","fromNode":"a100000000000009","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a10000000000000a","toSide":"top","label":"预算约束下的经济学应用"},
		{"id":"f100000000000005","fromNode":"a100000000000009","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a10000000000000b","toSide":"left","label":"驻点后只在可行\n切方向检查曲率"},
		{"id":"f100000000000006","fromNode":"a10000000000000b","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"c100000000000003","toSide":"top","label":"充分条件不能倒推系统可逆"},
		{"id":"f100000000000007","fromNode":"a10000000000000f","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a100000000000010","toSide":"top","label":"One of the four\nKKT conditions /\n四类 KKT 条件之一"},
		{"id":"f100000000000008","fromNode":"a100000000000010","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"c100000000000006","toSide":"top","label":"A zero product allows\nboth factors to vanish /\n零乘积允许两项都为零"},
		{"id":"f100000000000009","fromNode":"a10000000000000d","fromSide":"left","toNode":"c100000000000007","toSide":"right","label":"Existing multipliers\nat the same point /\n同一点已有乘子的唯一性"},
		{"id":"f10000000000000a","fromNode":"a10000000000000d","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"c100000000000008","toSide":"top","label":"Failure still allows KKT /\n失败仍可能有 KKT"},
		{"id":"f10000000000000b","fromNode":"a10000000000000d","fromSide":"left","toNode":"c100000000000005","toSide":"right","label":"C¹ local optimum + LICQ /\nC¹ 局部最优与 LICQ"},
		{"id":"f10000000000000c","fromNode":"a10000000000000d","fromSide":"right","toNode":"c100000000000004","toSide":"left","label":"Given-point\ngradient test /\n指定可行点的梯度检查"},
		{"id":"f10000000000000d","fromNode":"a10000000000000e","fromSide":"left","toNode":"c100000000000004","toSide":"right","label":"全局严格可行性与局部\n活动梯度不是同一条件"},
		{"id":"f10000000000000e","fromNode":"a10000000000000e","fromSide":"top","toNode":"c100000000000009","toSide":"bottom","label":"严格可行性启动强对偶"},
		{"id":"f10000000000000f","fromNode":"c100000000000009","fromSide":"left","toNode":"c100000000000005","toSide":"right","label":"Slater route at\nan attained optimum /\n已取得最优点的 Slater 路线"},
		{"id":"f100000000000010","fromNode":"a100000000000011","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"c10000000000000a","toSide":"top","label":"Global optimality alone does\nnot identify multipliers /\n全局最优不单独确定乘子"},
		{"id":"f100000000000011","fromNode":"a100000000000012","fromSide":"right","toNode":"e100000000000001","toSide":"left","label":"数值与实现它的选择集合分开"},
		{"id":"f100000000000012","fromNode":"a100000000000012","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a100000000000015","toSide":"top","label":"Envelope 直接追踪最优价值"},
		{"id":"f100000000000013","fromNode":"e100000000000001","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a100000000000014","toSide":"top","label":"IFT 追踪一条局部选择分支"},
		{"id":"f100000000000014","fromNode":"e100000000000001","fromSide":"right","toNode":"e100000000000002","toSide":"left","label":"当前最优集决定价值的方向导数"},
		{"id":"f100000000000015","fromNode":"e100000000000002","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a100000000000016","toSide":"top","label":"多解时直接检查价值方向导数"},
		{"id":"f100000000000016","fromNode":"a100000000000015","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a100000000000017","toSide":"top","label":"约束右端的包络导数给影子价格"},
		{"id":"f100000000000017","fromNode":"a100000000000009","fromSide":"right","toNode":"b100000000000001","toSide":"left"},
		{"id":"f100000000000018","fromNode":"b100000000000001","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a10000000000000f","toSide":"left","label":"Add inequality\nfeasibility and signs /\n加入不等式可行性与符号"},
		{"id":"f10000000000001a","fromNode":"a100000000000003","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a100000000000004","toSide":"left","label":"Attainment first; differentiable\ninterior candidates next ·\n先问取得性，再查可微内点候选"},
		{"id":"f100000000000019","fromNode":"a10000000000000f","fromSide":"right","toNode":"c100000000000005","toSide":"top","label":"Necessity under the\nstated qualification /\n给定资格下的必要性"},
		{"id":"f10000000000001b","fromNode":"a10000000000000f","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a100000000000011","toSide":"top","label":"Global sufficiency under\nthe stated shapes /\n给定形状下的全局充分性"},
		{"id":"f10000000000001c","fromNode":"a100000000000009","fromSide":"left","toNode":"c100000000000002","toSide":"right","label":"法向系数不等于罚函数参数"},
		{"id":"f10000000000001d","fromNode":"a100000000000007","fromSide":"right","toNode":"b100000000000004","toSide":"left","label":"Sufficient structure /\n充分结构"},
		{"id":"f10000000000001e","fromNode":"b100000000000004","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a100000000000011","toSide":"top","label":"Concavity and complementarity\ngive the certificate /\n凹性与互补性给出证书"},
		{"id":"a100000000000004-sofp-stationary","fromNode":"a100000000000004","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"sofp-stationary","toSide":"top","label":"A differentiable interior\nextremum is stationary ·\n可微内点极值必为驻点"},
		{"id":"sofp-stationary-sofp-global","fromNode":"sofp-stationary","fromSide":"right","toNode":"sofp-global","toSide":"left","label":"On an open convex domain,\ndifferentiable concavity\nmakes stationarity sufficient ·\n开凸域上，可微凹性使驻点条件充分"},
		{"id":"sofp-global-sofp-quasi","fromNode":"sofp-global","fromSide":"right","toNode":"sofp-quasi","toSide":"left","label":"Quasiconcavity alone\nis insufficient /\n仅拟凹不够"}
	]
}